                                                "sense_id": "784cf8b0-e536-38db-b720-726a6bbec4c8",
                                                "text": "By this little digression into Gascony, the Duke had an opportunity... to re-inforce himself with some particular Servants of his."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
